file C:\My Documents\customs letter.txt
	icon: res://win95/theme/icons/document_text_32.png
	contents:
		Harbour Import AB
		
		To: Customs, Port of Stockholm
		
		Re: Container HBIU 447120 from Rotterdam
		
		Dear Sir or Madam,
		
		Our container HBIU 447120 has been held at the port since May 24.
		The missing invoice is enclosed. Please release the goods at your
		earliest convenience, as our customer is waiting.
		
		Kind regards,
		
		Sam Hilton
		Harbour Import AB
		
	modified: Thursday, May 30, 1996 2:31:05 PM

